# Env files and their ops backups (BUG-03): these hold live DB/JWT/AWS secrets.
# The patterns above only matched names *ending* in `.env`, so `.env` itself was
# covered by luck and `.env.bak-*` / `.env.local.bak-*` were not covered at all.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

